The prices is a list of 3, 3, 5, 0, 0, 3, 1, and 4.
The last is the last position of prices.
The firstbuy is -1000000.
The firstsell is 0.
The secondbuy is -1000000.
The secondsell is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The price is item spot of prices.
The trial is 0 minus price.
If trial is more than firstbuy, set firstbuy to trial.
The trial is firstbuy plus price.
If trial is more than firstsell, set firstsell to trial.
The trial is firstsell minus price.
If trial is more than secondbuy, set secondbuy to trial.
The trial is secondbuy plus price.
If trial is more than secondsell, set secondsell to trial.

Show secondsell.
